"Hey Muse" wake word (core/wake/hey_muse.tflite)
  A microWakeWord model hey-muse trained, with
  https://github.com/TaterTotterson/microWakeWord-Trainer-AppleSilicon on microWakeWord (Apache
  License 2.0, Kevin Ahrendt), from synthetic speech and the datasets core/wake/README.md lists.
  None of those recordings is in this repository. core/wake/testdata holds two lines said by SVOX
  Pico, for the tests.

